# Emotes and spells for Macbeth; see plays/muchado.actions for the format.
# Repeating an entry matches the next occurrence of the same text.
#
# Ghosts and apparitions shimmer (Fade) when they appear, so the audience
# still sees them, and vanish (Invisibility, Stealth or Shadowmeld) when they
# go. A rogue or night elf ghost must step out of stealth themselves before
# rising again.

# Banquo's ghost at the banquet (Act 3, Scene 4)
BANQUO     | The Ghost of Banquo rises       | Fade
BANQUO     | Ghost disappears                | Invisibility, Stealth, Shadowmeld
BANQUO     | Ghost rises again               | Fade
BANQUO     | Ghost disappears                | Invisibility, Stealth, Shadowmeld

# The apparitions and the show of kings (Act 4, Scene 1)
APPARITION | Thunder. An Apparition of an armed Head | Fade
APPARITION | Descends                        | Invisibility, Stealth, Shadowmeld
APPARITION | Thunder. An Apparition of a bloody Child | Fade
APPARITION | Descends                        | Invisibility, Stealth, Shadowmeld
APPARITION | Thunder. An Apparition of a Child crowned | Fade
APPARITION | Descends                        | Invisibility, Stealth, Shadowmeld
BANQUO     | A show of eight kings           | Fade
